---
import {activeReleaseContext} from '../lib/release-context';
import {siteHref} from '../lib/site-context';
interface Props { standalone?: boolean; loginOnly?: boolean; }
const {standalone=false,loginOnly=false}=Astro.props;
const fallback=import.meta.env.BASE_URL==='/'?'/tools/account-export/':siteHref('/tools/account-export/',activeReleaseContext);
const configured=import.meta.env.PUBLIC_GROWTH_TOOL_URL;
const toolHref=typeof configured==='string'&&/^https:\/\//.test(configured)?configured:fallback;
---
<details class:list={['inventory-import-panel account-growth',{'account-growth--standalone':standalone}]} data-account-growth open={standalone}>
  <summary>登录与导入 <span>读取后预览，确认再保存</span></summary>
  <p class="inventory-help">{loginOnly?'从游戏读取成员卡、留影、乐器、角色评级和 TGW，预览确认后保存，各工具共用。':'导入本站养成备份、旧卡库 JSON，或从游戏读取成员卡、留影、乐器、角色评级和 TGW。预览确认后保存，各工具共用。'}</p>
  <div class="growth-import-methods">
  <section class="growth-import-method">
  <h3>游戏账号登录</h3>
  <p class="inventory-help">支持港澳台服 BHK 邮箱账号。Google 绑定账号暂未接入。</p>
  <form data-growth-login>
    <fieldset data-growth-login-fields disabled>
      <legend class="growth-sr-only">BHK 登录信息</legend>
      <div class="growth-login-fields">
        <label>BHK 账号邮箱<input type="email" name="account" required maxlength="320" autocomplete="off" data-growth-account /></label>
        <label>密码<input type="password" name="password" required autocomplete="off" data-growth-password /></label>
      </div>
      <p class="inventory-help">账号密码经本站服务端请求官方服务，不保存密码或令牌。登录可能使游戏会话失效，遇到额外验证会停止。</p>
      <button type="submit">登录并读取养成</button>
    </fieldset>
  </form>
  <p role="status" aria-live="polite" data-growth-service-status>正在检查网页登录服务…</p>
  <button type="button" data-growth-retry hidden>重新检查登录服务</button>
  </section>
  <section class="growth-import-method" hidden={loginOnly}>
  <h3>导入 JSON 备份</h3>
  <p class="inventory-help">使用已保存的养成文件恢复档案。文件仅在当前浏览器解析，不上传服务器。</p>
  <div class="inventory-toolbar">
    <label>导入养成 JSON<input type="file" accept=".json,application/json" data-growth-file /></label>
    <a href={toolHref} data-growth-tool-link>开源／本地工具</a>
  </div>
  <p class="inventory-help">也可使用本地工具读取游戏养成，再导入这里。</p>
  </section>
  </div>
  <p role="status" aria-live="polite" data-growth-status>{loginOnly?'读取后先核对卡库与养成，再确认保存。':'请选择个人养成备份、旧卡库 JSON 或本地工具导出的养成 JSON。'}</p>
  <div data-growth-preview class="inventory-preview" hidden></div>
  <div class="inventory-toolbar" data-growth-actions hidden>
    <button type="button" class="growth-primary" data-growth-apply disabled>保存为当前养成</button>
    <button type="button" data-growth-download disabled>下载预览 JSON</button>
    <button type="button" data-growth-undo disabled>撤销此次养成导入</button>
  </div>
</details>
